---
description: Engineering handbook and fork policy
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/engineering-handbook/` before changing anything.

- Push and open pull requests only to this project's own repository, with
  `gh pr create --repo OWNER/REPO --base BASE --head BRANCH` (values from `AGENTS.md`).
- Never push to, or open a pull request against, the parent repository.
- Never commit to the default branch, force-push, merge or deploy.
- Never print or commit secrets.
- Run the required checks in `AGENTS.md` and report results, including anything not run.
- Stay inside the owned files and scope given in your assignment.
